  "notes": {
    "en": "The phone's chat is steadier, and SSH remote development had several long-standing bugs fixed.\n\nFixed\n- Remote projects no longer list another program's sessions: a server left running since before an upgrade kept reading the old sessions folder; each build's daemon is now its own, and the old ones die out.\n- An MCP server switched off in Settings → Customize is really off: never connected, its tools never in the context (before, they were only refused when called, their schemas in every request). In LangshenAgent's own core the switch applies to a running session at once.\n- Moving the data folder no longer leaves data behind: the Claude sessions, bots, usage records and update files move with it now.\n- The phone's conversation holds its pin to the bottom as answers stream, pairing draws the scan frame's sweep, and the link dials link-local IPv6 where nothing else is found.\n\nNote: turning MCP servers off fully applies on the built-in core; with the official CLI their tools are still listed (as Claude Code itself does) and only their calls are refused.",
    "zh": "手机端聊天更顺手了，远程开发修了好几个老问题。\n\n修复\n- 远程项目不再列出别的程序的会话:升级前留下的旧远程服务会一直用旧的会话目录,现在每个版本的服务各管各的,旧的自然退场。\n- 设置 → 自定义里关掉的 MCP 真正关掉了:不再连接、工具不占上下文(之前只是调用时被拦,工具仍然注入)。内置核心下开关即时生效。\n- 迁移数据目录不再丢数据:Claude 会话、bots、用量记录之前迁移时会被落下。\n- 手机端聊天跟随流式输出稳定停在底部,配对页的扫码框有了扫描动画;连接在只有 link-local IPv6 时也能拨通。\n\n注意:远程主机改用\"内置\"核心后,关 MCP 才完全生效;官方 CLI 下工具仍会列出(这是 Claude Code 官方行为),只是调用被拒。"
  },
